        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 293.1,
          "end": 296.85,
          "en": "through FirebaseFirestore instance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 296.85,
          "end": 300.6,
          "en": "And then there, we again reach out to a collection,",
