        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 339.65999999999997,
          "end": 340.83299999999997,
          "en": "that we stored there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 342.24,
          "end": 344.67,
          "en": "Now get in the end returns a future,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 344.67,
          "end": 347.04,
          "en": "which then in the end will give us access",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 347.04,
          "end": 349.23,
          "en": "to the fetched data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 349.23,
          "end": 351.87,
          "en": "Therefore here, to use async await,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 351.87,
          "end": 356.763,
          "en": "I'll add async here on this submitMessage method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 357.81,
          "end": 361.05,
          "en": "And then we can await this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 361.05,
          "end": 366.05,
          "en": "So, here we get the userData, by awaiting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 366.21,
          "end": 368.307,
          "en": "this get request here in the end.,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 369.54,
          "end": 373.593,
          "en": "and then here we can set username equal to userData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 374.52,
          "end": 378.6,
          "en": "And then, this actually is a so-called document snapshot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 378.6,
          "end": 383.01,
          "en": "which is a type of data provided by Firebase.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 383.01,
          "end": 386.55,
          "en": "And this object has a data method which we can call,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 386.55,
          "end": 389.7,
          "en": "to in the end, get access to the actual data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 389.7,
          "end": 392.763,
          "en": "that was stored in the document as a map.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 394.14,
          "end": 396.3,
          "en": "We have to add an exclamation mark",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 396.3,
          "end": 398.82,
          "en": "to convince Dart that this will not be null.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 398.82,
          "end": 401.34000000000003,
          "en": "It could be null if we're trying to fetch data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 401.34000000000003,
          "end": 405,
          "en": "for a document that doesn't exist, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 405,
          "end": 407.88,
          "en": "But here we know that we have an authenticated user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 407.88,
          "end": 410.13,
          "en": "and therefore it will exist.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 410.13,
          "end": 412.77,
          "en": "So, we can add the exclamation mark here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 412.77,
          "end": 415.26,
          "en": "and then we'll be working with that map,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 415.26,
          "end": 417.27,
          "en": "so we can use square up brackets,",
          "zh": ""
